    <h1 class="home-thesis">A battery is lithium, two tanks and bookkeeping. <span>The complexity is in the curves, not in the logic.</span></h1>
    <p class="home-lead">Charge Tanks follows the lithium through a cell from scratch: anode and cathode as two tanks hanging from one ceiling, with small tools that compute along and the math folded away for whoever wants it.</p>
