      <figcaption>Graphite against NMC at half charge: the two tanks, shaped by their dQ/dV curves, and the same state as two potential curves. The cell voltage is the distance between them.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="home-byline">Written by <a href="/about/">Lars von Kolzenberg</a>, principal battery model developer at Breathe, PhD on SEI growth at Ulm University.</p>
